  Enable full access?
  With full access Estelle can edit any file on this machine and run networked
  commands, unapproved. Exercise caution when enabling full access. This
  significantly increases the risk of data loss, leaks, or unexpected
  behavior.

› 1. Yes, continue anyway  Apply full access for this session
  2. Cancel                Go back without enabling full access

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
